WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.500
My business feels better now because it feels consistent, and I'm able to enjoy it more.

00:07.500 --> 00:13.500
It was so volatile in the past that I'd go through these highs and lows.

00:13.500 --> 00:20.500
But working with Lucas has allowed me to view the business differently. It's working.

00:20.500 --> 00:27.240
There's a great energy when you get a regular number of people enrolling each week. That feels better. It feels more fun.
